# Scratch left behind by the scheduled tasks in ~/.claude/scheduled-tasks/.
#
# Those tasks are SKILL.md prompts, not scripts: the agent writes whatever helper
# it needs at run time, and its cwd is this repo, so the helpers land here. They
# are working artefacts of a run, never an entry point — nothing references them.
#
# Removed 2026-08-28 after daily-color-post/ accumulated two of them. Keeping
# them was actively harmful, not just untidy: run-post.mjs still built its links
# on colorarchive.me, the domain retired in the .org migration, and a future run
# that found it in the repo could have copied that straight back in. The live
# SKILL.md has the correct .org — the stale copy was the only thing carrying the
# old domain.
.claude/scheduled-tasks/
demo-video/
*.tmp
tts-samples/

